  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIBE. Processing of farmer retained seed in rural areas in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implement initiatives to boost crop yield by offering on-site seed cleaning, sorting, and treatment services. Establish a Joint Venture for crop seed processing. Create a thorough business plan covering market analysis, rollout strategy, and target demographics. Expect to generate 8-12 jobs per unit, focusing on logistics and packaging, with room for growth after market entry.</narrative>
